event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/plan.md\", \"content\": \"Plan for mission \\\"greet, tested\\\":\\n\\n1. Dispatch dev to implement src/greet.py with greet(name) -\u003e \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"\\n   and tests/test_greet.py covering a normal name and the empty string, then\\n   run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` and commit to dev's branch.\\n2. Wait for dev's reply.\\n3. Judge: fetch dev's branch, inspect src/greet.py and tests/test_greet.py,\\n   run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` myself against the fetched\\n   tree to confirm exit code 0, and check both required test cases (a normal\\n   name, and the empty string) are actually present and meaningful (not\\n   vacuous asserts).\\n4. Accept if all three criteria hold; otherwise send precise rework describing\\n   exactly what's missing/wrong.\\n5. Once accepted, reply to mission m1 with --outcome campaign-met (or the\\n   appropriate alternative if something remains unmet after reasonable\\n   iteration, per the small-mission \\\"wrap up honestly if it stalls\\\" guidance).\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

